  "description": "Old English Spider is a spooky twist on the classic blackletter style, infused with cobweb details and creepy flair. This gothic-inspired display font is ideal for Halloween posters, haunted invitations, gothic apparel, or any dark-themed design needing a vintage horror vibe. It’s dramatic, bold, and full of Halloween spirit.\nMake your spooky season projects scream style with Old English Spider—where medieval meets monstrous.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Old English Spider is a spooky twist on the classic blackletter style, infused with cobweb details and creepy flair. This gothic-inspired display font is ideal for Halloween posters, haunted invitations, gothic apparel, or any dark-themed design needing a vintage horror vibe. It’s dramatic, bold, and full of Halloween spirit.</p>\n<p>Make your spooky season projects scream style with <em>Old English Spider</em>—where medieval meets monstrous.</p>",
